# Pairs with ClimbsOnlyAfterSeed. A division reported before seeding names a parent the leaves do not know yet.
MODULE: SeedCompleteEarly
TARGET: ClimbsOnlyAfterSeed
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: the root carries the division up before both leaves have been seeded
PERTURBS: SeedComplete

--- FIND
    /\ ch[o] = "seed"
    /\ \A l \in Leaves : seed[l] = "done"
--- REPLACE
    /\ ch[o] = "seed"
    \* MUTATION: the seeding is not awaited
--- END
